9
00:00:56.832 --> 00:01:04.320
Hannah: I'll report tests already completed on Friday. We won't run experiments during this call.

10
00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:11.760
Priya: Dashboard redesign? Let's park that for now. So, start with the patch progress.

